{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53374","headline":"谒赠何国子监司籍坚 · 阳城","name":"谒赠何国子监司籍坚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"久仰高明抱朴忠，倏传马首向城东。\n锦袍光射三千里，汗史功高百二雄。\n童稚候门烹雀舌，黎老植杖盼菊松。\n皇天应欲逸家辅，故遣盘桓醉碧筒。\n（见光绪三年刊许清源纂《道州志》卷十一）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"阳城","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53374.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53374","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}